OL,3,GNEWSAPCs who 'saved each other's lives'
OL,4,Acommended
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers who were attacked
OL,7,Fwith a knife in a "harrowing" ordeal
OL,8,Fhave been commended for their bravery.
OL,10,FPC Heather Watson and PC Matthew
OL,11,FJohnston were called to a property in
OL,12,FCarlisle on 28 May 2025, when a woman
OL,13,Ftrapped Watson in a corner, slashed her
OL,14,Facross the nose and then attempted to
OL,15,Fstab Johnston.
OL,17,FHannah Smaile, 26, was jailed for four
OL,18,Fyears in December after admitting
OL,19,Fthreatening the PCs with a knife and
OL,20,Fassaulting Johnston and Watson, who
OL,21,Frequired eight stitches to her face,
OL,22,Ftwo weeks before her wedding day.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
