OL,3,GNEWSAPCs who 'saved each other's lives'
OL,4,Acommended
OL,5,
OL,6,FSgt Stuart Mitchelhill said it was
OL,7,F"beyond doubt that both officers were
OL,8,Fresponsible that day for saving one
OL,9,Fanother's lives", describing their
OL,10,Factions as "courageous".
